## 2. Scope Contract & File Whitelist

<scope_contract>
  <allowed_files>
    <file>[exact/path/to/file1.ts]</file>
    <file>[exact/path/to/file1.test.ts]</file>
  </allowed_files>

  <forbidden_files>
    <file>[any/file/outside/the/scope]</file>
  </forbidden_files>

  <negative_constraints>
    - DO NOT refactor unrelated code or styles outside the immediate fix.
    - DO NOT bump dependencies or modify lockfiles unless explicitly requested.
    - DO NOT edit existing test cases to pass; only add reproduction/regression tests.
  </negative_constraints>
</scope_contract>

