<execution_plan>
  <!-- Living Scratchpad (Update after each slice to prevent goal drift) -->
  <living_scratchpad>
    - **Completed:** [List completed slices]
    - **Current:** [Active slice in progress]
    - **Blockers:** [None or active issue]
    - **Next Steps:** [Next slice or verification action]
